{"id":"mentira","lemma":"mentira","pos":"noun","rank":874,"glosses":["lie, trick, falsity"],"ipa":"/menˈtiɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mentiras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-mentira.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuándo dije una mentira?","en":"When have I told a lie?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/589693","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ella me dijo que no dijera mentiras.","en":"She told me not to tell lies.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641889","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},null]},{"text":"¿Crees que lo que ella dijo es mentira?","en":"Do you think what she said is a lie?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/410368","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},null,null,null,{"g":"she"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null],"phrases":[[1,4,"what's up, wassup"]]},{"text":"Ya me he cansado de tus mentiras.","en":"I've had enough of your lying.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611694","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"tired, weary, wearied"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Eso es totalmente mentira.","en":"That's a total lie.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/929674","words":[null,null,{"g":"totally"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"]]}]}